{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 23, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark a journey to the Land of the Rising Sun a most wondrous quest I shall devise for thee.\n\n**Day First Arrival in Tokyo a Metropolis of Light**\n\nFrom distant shores thou shalt arrive at Narita's gate.\nA taxi swift shall carry thee to lodging great.\nShinjuku's heights a view most grand and bold.\nDinner awaits a tale in flavors told.\n\n**Day Second Tokyo's Ancient Heart**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple a journey we shall take.\nSenso-ji's splendor for goodness sake.\nThen Ueno Park where art doth reside.\nMuseums rich with treasures deep inside.\nEvening pleasures in Shibuya's vibrant scene.\nCross the scramble a sight serene.\n\n**Day Third Hakone's Mountain Majesty**\n\nA train doth whisk thee to Hakone's grace.\nMount Fuji's image a blessed face.\nCruise on Lake Ashi a vista fair.\nVolcanic hot springs beyond compare.\nArt museums beckon a cultural delight.\nA tranquil haven bathed in soft moonlight.\n\n**Day Fourth Kyoto's Imperial Charm**\n\nThe Shinkansen's speed a marvel to behold.\nTo Kyoto's ancient story to be told.\nGion's geishas a fleeting dream.\nTea houses whisper a peaceful gleam.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermillion hue.\nA thousand pathways forever new.\n\n**Day Fifth Kyoto's Golden Pavilion**\n\nKinkaku-ji's gleam a sight divine.\nReflecting beauty a light that doth shine.\nRyoan-ji's garden a zen embrace.\nStone arrangements a meditative space.\nNijo Castle's halls where shoguns did dwell.\nHistory's echoes a story to tell.\n\n**Day Sixth Nara's Deer and Temples Old**\n\nTo Nara we journey a city of deer.\nTodai-ji Temple's giant Buddha near.\nKasuga Taisha's lanterns softly glow.\nAncient spirits in gentle flow.\nA peaceful wander a moment to seize.\nAmongst the deer and rustling trees.\n\n**Day Seventh Osaka's Culinary Delights**\n\nOsaka's kitchen a feast for the soul.\nDotonbori's lights a vibrant whole.\nTakoyaki's taste a savory treat.\nOkonomiyaki's flavors oh so sweet.\nOsaka Castle's grandeur a sight to see.\nA city of laughter wild and free.\n\n**Day Eighth Departure Farewell Japan**\n\nFrom Kansai's airport thou shalt take flight.\nBearing memories bathed in golden light.\nOf temples gardens and cities so bright.\nA journey completed a wondrous sight.\nFarewell Japan until we meet once more.\nUpon thy shores forevermore.\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.011765611357986927}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.5240451097488403}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.9557386040687561}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.0015445933677256107}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.09841727465391159}, {"token": "▁Land", "logprob": -0.25907498598098755}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.03924280032515526}, {"token": "▁Rising", "logprob": -3.576272320060525e-06}, {"token": "▁Sun", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.041072435677051544}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.09256809949874878}, {"token": "▁wondrous", "logprob": -0.03838632255792618}, {"token": "▁quest", "logprob": -0.22013649344444275}, {"token": "▁I", "logprob": -0.19890150427818298}, {"token": "▁shall", "logprob": -0.008611921221017838}, {"token": "▁devise", "logprob": -1.3610239028930664}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.013003433123230934}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -2.253030106658116e-05}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.05856211110949516}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.007514898665249348}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -7.390948667307384e-06}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.0038106462452560663}, {"token": "▁First", "logprob": -1.3296129703521729}, {"token": "▁Arrival", "logprob": -0.47941112518310547}, {"token": "▁in", "logprob": -0.00041738382424227893}, {"token": "▁Tokyo", "logprob": -0.12808552384376526}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.5169283747673035}, {"token": "▁Metropolis", "logprob": -0.5022903680801392}, {"token": "▁of", "logpr